From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: castledking <thecastledking@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 17:15:23 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Villager POI search fixes

Vanilla only offers villagers beds, job sites and bells within 48 blocks in
all three axes. Since the 26.1 update Paper's AcquirePoi search passed no
distance limit, so it accepted POIs at any height within the horizontal
range and could never stop searching early. Pass the squared range again.

Make the AcquirePoi and baby bed sensor radius configurable, from Purpur.

Replace the hash set Moonrise's POI searches used to track visited sections
with a bitset over the search box. Sections are visited in the same order,
so results are unchanged.

